<img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S12.png' />", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715249, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 23}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "【答案】②  ； 玻璃棒<br>【考情点拨】本题考查了葡萄糖的砖红反应的知识点。<br>【应试指导】葡萄糖是还原性糖，有醛基，新制氢氧化铜悬浊液在加热条件下与醛基反应，被还原成砖红色沉淀。实验需要用玻璃棒进行搅拌。", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715250, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2021年成考高起本物理化学真题", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 6, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 6, "source": "2021", "starCount": 0, "title": "有一白色粉末是①NaC1、②葡萄糖、③NH<sub>4</sub>HCO<sub>3</sub>和④Na<sub>2</sub>CO<sub>3</sub>中的一种。现进行下列实验：<br>(1)取少量样品加水溶解后，用pH试纸测定溶液，呈中性。<br>(2)取少量样品，稍微加热，没有刺激性气味产生。<br>(3)取少量样品加水溶解后，加入新制氢氧化铜悬浊液，微热后有红色沉淀产生。根据实验现象判断这种白色粉末是______ (填序号)，上述实验中用到的玻璃仪器有试管、酒精灯、胶头滴管、表面皿和______。<br>", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715250, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 24}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "【答案】3<br>【考情点拨】本题考查了同分异构体的知识点。<br>【应试指导】C<sub>5</sub>H<sub>12</sub>的同分异构体一共有三种，分别为正戊烷、异戊烷和新戊烷。", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715251, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2021年成考高起本物理化学真题", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 3, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 3, "source": "2021", "starCount": 0, "title": "C<sub>5</sub>H<sub>12</sub>的同分异构体有______ 种。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715251, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 25}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "【答案】Li   ；<img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S18.png' /><br>【考情点拨】本题考查了短周期元素原子核外中子排布及电子式书写的知识点。<br>【应试指导】密度最小的气体单质元素是H,B、C最外层电子数都比次外层少1，故分别为L、Cl。<br>", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715252, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "填空题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2021年成考高起本物理化学真题", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 6, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 6, "source": "2021", "starCount": 0, "title": "A、B、C为三种短周期元素，原子序数依次增大。A元素单质为密度最小的气体；B与C两元素的原子最外层电子数都比其次外层电子数少1。则B的元素符号是______；A与C形成的化合物的电子式为______。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715252, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 26}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "(1)根据带电粒子在磁场中运动的规律，<br><img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S19.png' />", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715253, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "计算题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2021年成考高起本物理化学真题", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 11, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 11, "source": "2021", "starCount": 0, "title": "(11分)如图，质量为m、电荷量为q的粒子，从容器A下方的小孔S<sub>1</sub>不断进入加速电场，其初速度几乎为零。加速后的粒子经过小孔S<sub>2</sub>沿着与磁场垂直的方向进入磁感应强度为B的匀强磁场中，做半径为R的匀速圆周运动，运动半周后离开磁场。不计粒子的重力及粒子间的相互作用。求：<br><img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S13.png' /><br>(1)粒子在磁场中运动的速度大小v。<br>(2)加速电场的电压U。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715253, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 27}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "(1)由题意知，斜面高度为<br>h=dsin30°<br>根据能量关系，有<br><img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S20.png' />", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715254, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "计算题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2021年成考高起本物理化学真题", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 12, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 12, "source": "2021", "starCount": 0, "title": "(12分)质量为m=3.0kg的物块沿d=1.0m长的斜面从顶端由静止开始下滑。斜面与水平面间的夹角为30°，物块与斜面间的摩擦力f=8.7N。物块到达斜面底端后继续在水平地面上运动，已知物块与斜面之间和与地面之间的动摩擦因数相同，重力加速度为9.8/s<sup>2</sup>。求：<br>(1)物块到达斜面底端的速度v的大小。<br>(2)物块在地面上滑行的距离s(结果保留2位小数)。", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715254, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 28}, {"a": "", "accuracyAmount": 0, "analyze": "根据题意，由于NaClO的存在，说明H<sub>2</sub>与Cl<sub>2</sub>的反应中Cl<sub>2</sub>是过量的。发生下列3个反应<br><img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S21.png' /><br>由反应③生成的NaCIO物质的量为0.05mol可知，反应③中消耗Cl<sub>2</sub>和NaOH的量分别为0.05mol、0.1mol。<br>已知反应②③消耗的NaOH总量为<img src='http://ppt.beegoedu.com/CourseIMG/H011701/TKZT-2022/S22.png' />则反应②中消耗NaOH的量为0.3mol一0.1mol=0.2mol,反应②中消耗HCl的量为0.2mol。<br>由反应②中消耗HCl的量为0.2mol可知，反应①消耗H<sub>2</sub>和Cl<sub>2</sub>的量分别为0.1mol、0.1mol。<br>所以H<sub>2</sub>和Cl<sub>2</sub>之比为0.1mol:(0.1+0.05)mol=2:3。", "b": "", "c": "", "catId": 0, "correct": false, "correctTimesAmount": 0, "d": "", "diffCoeff": 1, "e": "", "econtent": "", "exerId": 2715255, "exerType": "历年真题", "f": "", "freqCoeff": 1, "g": "", "h": "", "htmlTag": true, "jcontent": "", "keyType": "计算题", "matRef": "", "myCollectionId": 0, "newKeyType": 3, "optNum": 1, "pptId": 0, "prName": "2021年成考高起本物理化学真题", "pracTimesAmount": 0, "questionType": 3, "reviewExerGroupRecId": 0, "rightKey": "", "rightRate": 0, "score": 10, "scoreLess": 0, "scoreRules": 0, "scoringMethod": 1, "simExamScore": 10, "source": "2021", "starCount": 0, "title": "(10分)一定量的氢气在氯气中充分燃烧，反应后的混合物用500mL、0.6mol/L冷的NaOH溶液恰好完全吸收，这时测得溶液中NaCIO的物质的量为0.05mol,则氢气和氯气的物质的内量之比为多少？", "topicType": "主观题", "ueId": 2715255, "umcId": 14407089, "userKey": "", "userKeyImg1": "", "userKeyImg2": "", "userKeyImg3": "", "userScore": 0, "wcId": 29}], "SimExamStore": {"ExerNum": 29, "CourseId": "H011701", "ExamTime": 150, "ExerSortType": 1, "ScoringMethod": 1, "TotalScore": 150, "SimType": "历年真题", "ExamName": "2021年成考高起本物理化学真题"}, "simId": 21624}